      IT_DATA_PV-PLNNR2 = PLNTY_TMP.
    ENDIF.

    MODIFY IT_DATA_PV. "TRANSPORTING PLNTY.
    CLEAR IT_DATA_PV.
  ENDLOOP.

*  SELECT WERKS MATNR VERID TEXT1 ADATU BDATU PLNTY PLNNR ALNAL STLAL STLAN
*    INTO CORRESPONDING FIELDS OF TABLE IT_DATA_PV
